But the approach matters, needs to be balanced, structured.

788
00:42:02,170 --> 00:42:06,150
The research often points to something like the SBI model situation, behavior, performance.

789
00:42:06,130 --> 00:42:06,890
Impact.

790
00:42:07,460 --> 00:42:15,730
So instead of you're disorganized, it's in the meeting last Tuesday situation when you presented the plan without a clear agenda behavior.

791
00:42:15,770 --> 00:42:19,180
It made it hard for the team to follow and figure out next steps.

792
00:42:19,560 --> 00:42:19,980
Impact.

