00:42:21,940 --> 00:42:23,240
That framework.

794
00:42:23,260 --> 00:42:28,630
Really powerful for giving feedback that's precise, actionable, good, solid business English practice, too.

795
00:42:28,860 --> 00:42:31,050
That specificity really changes the game.

796
00:42:31,250 --> 00:42:33,290
Sources say always try to start with something positive.

