00:42:33,360 --> 00:42:35,960
Genuine praise about a recent win set the better tone.

798
00:42:36,380 --> 00:42:38,450
Then address the development areas constructively.

799
00:42:38,870 --> 00:42:43,320
Focus on behavior, outcomes, use those concrete examples, makes it less subjective, more credible.

