833
00:44:15,990 --> 00:44:19,170
Maybe it's market forces, efficiency gains, new tech.

834
00:44:19,190 --> 00:44:22,010
Explain how it'll eventually make work better or easier.

835
00:44:21,990 --> 00:44:27,640
People are much more willing to accept change if they get the why and see a potential upside, not just another task.

836
00:44:27,660 --> 00:44:29,910
And dealing with concerns head-on seems vital.

837
00:44:30,230 --> 00:44:34,740
Open Q&As, maybe an anonymous feedback channel, plus proper training.

838
00:44:34,760 --> 00:44:39,080
Not just one workshop, but maybe hands-on sessions, online guides, peer support.

839
00:44:39,520 --> 00:44:40,660
Build that confidence.

840
00:44:40,680 --> 00:44:44,170
A detailed timeline with milestones and support contacts, that sounds smart too.

841
00:44:44,390 --> 00:44:46,210
Reduces anxiety, gives a roadmap.

842
00:44:46,190 --> 00:44:46,730
Definitely.

